{"id":"0caf6a4fb6071bd3","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md","title":"完备格上单调算子的固定点存在","display":"thm-fixed-point-existence — 完备格上单调算子的固定点存在","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-fixed-point-existence","aliases":["91-thm-fixed-point-existence","91-thm-kripke-fixed-point"],"display":"thm-fixed-point-existence — 完备格上单调算子的固定点存在","depends_on":["[[91-df-monotonicity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-fixed-point-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-fixed-point-existence</span><span>91-thm-kripke-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-existence — 完备格上单调算子的固定点存在"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55157d609cf296e7\" href=\"?note=55157d609cf296e7\" title=\"91-df-monotonicity\">91-df-monotonicity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\((L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> 为完备格；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_L,\\bigvee_L\">\\(\\bigwedge_L,\\bigvee_L\\)</span> 为环境格的下、上确界。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\(\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\((L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> 是完备格)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:L\\to L\">\\(J:L\\to L\\)</span> (自映射)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55157d609cf296e7\" href=\"?note=55157d609cf296e7\" title=\"91-df-monotonicity\">91-df-monotonicity</a> 的偏序单调性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\bigwedge_L\\{x\\in L:J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\bigwedge_L\\{x\\in L:J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\bigvee_L\\{x\\in L:x\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\bigvee_L\\{x\\in L:x\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\{x\\in L:J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\}\">\\(P=\\{x\\in L:J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=\\bigwedge_L P\">\\(p=\\bigwedge_L P\\)</span>。\n最大元属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>，故该集合非空。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in P\">\\(x\\in P\\)</span>，单调性给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(p)\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\">\\(J(p)\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\)</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(p)\\sqsubseteq p\">\\(J(p)\\sqsubseteq p\\)</span>。\n再次用单调性得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(J(p))\\sqsubseteq J(p)\">\\(J(J(p))\\sqsubseteq J(p)\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(p)\\in P\">\\(J(p)\\in P\\)</span>；\n下确界性质于是给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\sqsubseteq J(p)\">\\(p\\sqsubseteq J(p)\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(p)=p\">\\(J(p)=p\\)</span>。\n每个固定点都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 中，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 小于等于每个固定点。对\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\{x\\in L:x\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\}\">\\(Q=\\{x\\in L:x\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=\\bigvee_L Q\">\\(q=\\bigvee_L Q\\)</span> 作对偶论证，\n得到最大固定点。此处的上下界属于任意集合大小完备格，不能从专用于\n句子代码幂集的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min},X_{\\max}\">\\(X_{\\min},X_{\\max}\\)</span> 定义直接导入。</p>\n<p>这是 Knaster–Tarski 定理。若强 Kleene 真理跳跃扩展在一个完备信息格上，\n可直接应用本定理。只取一致三值信息时，该偏序通常不是完备格；这时应\n利用递增链的并保持一致以及超限迭代，另证极小一致固定点存在。</p>\n<p>“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 已定义”不足以推出固定点存在：例如任意集合上的无固定点置换同样\n定义良好。完备格、自映射和单调性是这里明确使用的条件；固定点是否\n唯一还要分析具体算子。</p>\n<p>来源：标准 Knaster–Tarski 定理及上述证明；原书 §8.7、§15.1 使用其幂集情形，本节点是明确标示的一般背景结果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"55157d609cf296e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-monotonicity]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"55157d609cf296e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)$ 采用 [[91-df-monotonicity]] 的偏序单调性。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge_L,\\bigvee_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"J:L\\to L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\bigwedge_L\\{x\\in L:J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\bigvee_L\\{x\\in L:x\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"P=\\{x\\in L:J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p=\\bigwedge_L P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"J(p)\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\sqsubseteq x","display":false},{"tex":"J(p)\\sqsubseteq p","display":false},{"tex":"J(J(p))\\sqsubseteq J(p)","display":false},{"tex":"J(p)\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"p\\sqsubseteq J(p)","display":false},{"tex":"J(p)=p","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"Q=\\{x\\in L:x\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"q=\\bigvee_L Q","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\min},X_{\\max}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false}],"bytes":2580,"backlinks":[{"id":"832d8d672c5cd995","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{lfp}(J),\\operatorname{gfp}(J)$ 采用 [[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]] 的一般完备格构造。"},{"id":"14209f87e5536e32","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"85bd8bb39708cdd0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{lfp}(J)$ 采用 [[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]] 的一般完备格定义。"},{"id":"414e6c47808f5b0a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{lfp}(J),\\operatorname{gfp}(J)$ 采用 [[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]] 的环境格构造。"},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["55157d609cf296e7"]}